WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.204
The tests pass, but one step only repeated a failed command.

00:00:06.204 --> 00:00:12.057
PRL puts a Python function between rollout and the policy
update.

00:00:12.057 --> 00:00:14.984
Your idea goes into one function. PRL calls it on every finished
trajectory.

00:00:14.984 --> 00:00:26.691
Reweight: decide how much each step, or its reasoning, trains. A
judge can pick the steps.

00:00:26.691 --> 00:00:35.472
Rewrite: edit what a step says. The new text can stay context
only, out of the loss.

00:00:35.472 --> 00:00:47.179
Reroll: let the policy try again from a step. The new samples
are scored by the tests.

00:00:47.179 --> 00:00:55.960
Mix all three in one function, or chain ready transforms.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:01:02.000
Start with a transform: github.com/TokenWave-AI/PRL
